'''Pararila Peninsula''' (パラリラ半島 ''Pararira Hantō'', '''Pararila Peninsula''') is the 9th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 58th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter contains very strange stages. Some are easy with the correct strategy, while others make you suffer even with the right cats. Make yourself at home, since you are going to stay in this sub-chapter for a while.

{{LegendDiff|150|200|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces no new enemies. However, the [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien Enemies]] from [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 2 make their first appearance in Uncanny Legends here.
*[[Kid Tappa]]: A Starred Alien that rushes into your frontline to tank and only to tank. Their barrier may give some trouble, but their health is the issue.
*[[Ribbo]]: A Starred Alien variant of Croakley, this frog is quite easy, even with their troubling Warps. Break their barrier, and they die.

